Package: multicred
Version: @VERSION@
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: python3 (>= 3.12), python3-gi, python3-gi-cairo, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1 (>= 1.5), gir1.2-secret-1, libsecret-tools, git
Recommends: gh
Maintainer: MultiCred <noreply@multicred.app>
Homepage: https://github.com/Rafael-Leivas/MultiCred
Description: troca de identidade de dev com um clique
 Troca, de forma transacional, a identidade do git, a conta ativa do GitHub
 CLI, a pasta e a conta do Claude Code e as chaves de API dos terminais.
 Fica na bandeja do COSMIC (Pop!_OS) e do GNOME (Ubuntu).
